OL,3,ATrump and Zelensky appear at
OL,4,Aloggerheads despite Oslo optimism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hug that Trump envoy Steve Witkoff
OL,7,Foffered Volodymyr Zelensky ahead of
OL,8,Fthis afternoon's talks in Oslo is
OL,9,Funlikely to have dispelled the
OL,10,FUkrainian leader's misgivings about the
OL,11,Fcurrent direction of US policy towards
OL,12,Fhis war-ravaged country.
OL,14,FZelensky posted a video of the moment
OL,15,Fon social media, with the message
OL,16,F"Ukraine is working for peace. I thank
OL,17,Four partners for their support!"
OL,19,FBut given everything that's happened
OL,20,Fthis month, does the Ukrainian leader
OL,21,Fstill regard Donald Trump as a partner?
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
